  "description": "Rakuten Ichiba / Rakuten Affiliate Japan. Official catalog/detail Search and Genre calls use documented v2026-07-01 APIs and require a caller registered applicationId plus accessKey; affiliateId is caller supplied. The separate public Reviews page API returns individual review bodies, dates, ratings, pagination and review-photo thumbnails without a user account, using a short-lived in-memory key bootstrapped from current first-party page JS. Distinct from Rakuten Advertising global publisher APIs. Public consumer Document readers added on 2026-10-15 support home genres, category/search pages, product detail and SKU observations without app credentials; these are separate from the official credentialed API.",
